#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:software_workflow_dec.mail_notification_layout
msgid ""
"If you did not previously have access to the portal, then you should have received a second email, "
"entitled"
msgstr ""
"Si vous n'aviez pas encore accès au portail, vous devriez avoir reçu un deuxième courriel, intitulé"

#. module: software_workflow_dec
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:software_workflow_dec.mail_notification_layout
msgid ""
"Our portal allows you to view your orders and invoices, as well as manage your licenses and "
"subscriptions or those of your establishment. You can also create a support ticket for an after-sales "
"service request."
msgstr ""
"Notre portail vous permet de consulter vos commandes et vos factures, ainsi que de gérer vos licences "
"et abonnements ou ceux de votre établissement. Vous pouvez également créer un ticket d'assistance pour "
"une demande de service après-vente."

#. module: software_workflow_dec
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:software_workflow_dec.mail_notification_layout
msgid "Please note that you must not share this link with the public!"
msgstr "Veuillez noter que vous ne devez pas partager ce lien publiquement !"

#. module: software_workflow_dec
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:software_workflow_dec.mail_notification_layout
msgid "Read the user guide"
msgstr "Lire le manuel d'utilisation"

#. module: software_workflow_dec
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:software_workflow_dec.mail_notification_layout
msgid "The DEC e-space software user guide is freely available at :"
msgstr "Le guide de l'utilisateur du logiciel e-space DEC est accessible à l'adresse suivante :"

